<title>MEXICO: Mexico daily port, shipping update for June 13.</title>
<headline>Mexico daily port, shipping update for June 13.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>All major Mexican ports were open to shipping on Friday, the Communications and Transport Ministry (SCT) said in an update.</p>
<p>Only Puerto Penasco on Mexico's Pacific Coast was closed to outgoing small vessels, namely tourist and fishing boats, the SCT said.</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom +525 7287902))</p>
</text>
